# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Jarvis Workspace — environment variables (Docker).
#   cp .env.example .env   and edit whatever you need. NEVER commit your .env.
# WHERE THE FILE GOES: the engine looks for it in `plotspace/.env` (the repo) and
# in `<data_dir>/.env` (the INSTALLED app, next to jarvis.db — there is no repo
# there). A .env left only in the WSL checkout is NOT seen by the Windows engine.
# All of them have a sane default: the one you almost always want to set is
# PROYECTOS_DIR (where your code lives on the host).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── PROJECTS (host → container) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# ABSOLUTE path on your HOST to the directory that holds your code projects.
# It is mounted inside the container at /proyectos. When creating a project in
# the UI, use the CONTAINER path (e.g. /proyectos/my-app). Read by docker-compose.yml.
# Default if left empty: ./proyectos (relative to this repo).
PROYECTOS_DIR=/home/your-user/projects

# ── Anthropic API key (OPTIONAL) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only used by the ORCHESTRATOR (Jarvis chat) and the WEB BUILDER. Claude
# Code/Codex agents use THEIR OWN auth (you link it in the UI → ⚙ → Accounts),
# so the core BYOK flow does NOT need this key. Leave it empty if you are not
# going to use the orchestrator chat or the Web Builder.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── Voice dictation (REQUIRED if you want to dictate) ────────────────────────
# Dictation transcribes on Groq (whisper-large-v3-turbo, free tier). WITHOUT this
# key /api/voice/transcribe answers 503 and the symptom does NOT look like "a
# variable is missing": the mic records normally and the text comes back EMPTY.
# Get it free at https://console.groq.com/keys.
GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_STT_MODEL=whisper-large-v3   # higher quality, slower (default: turbo)

# ── Swarm flags (defaults: all ON) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Set the value to "off" to turn the corresponding poller off.
# WATCHDOG=off   # safety net that rescues lost TASK_DONE / stalled steps
# SENTINEL=off   # structured step closure via file (primary source)

# ── Web Builder (AI page generator) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# WB_OJO=off                       # turns off post-generation visual polish (the "Eye")
# WB_OJO_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6   # model for the Eye's visual critic
# WB_GUSTO_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6 # model that distills the user's taste settings

# ── Radio: Spotify (V2, OPTIONAL) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Radio music search with the USER's account (OAuth PKCE, the session lives in
# data/spotify-token.json). client_id is REQUIRED for the "Spotify" button to
# log in; client_secret is OPTIONAL (PKCE is valid with client_id alone). Create
# the app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard (free): → Create app →
# Redirect URI:
#   http://localhost:3000/api/radio/spotify/callback
# NEVER commit these values. LOCAL music (data/music/) needs nothing.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ── Advanced (rarely needed) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# JARVIS_ALLOWED_HOSTS=my-host.local   # extra allowed hosts/origins (CSV)
# JARVIS_MAX_BODY_MB=256               # request size cap (uploads/zip)
